<view class="page">
  <view class="head">
    <text class="head-en">SUPPLIER DESK</text>
    <text class="head-cn">供应商管理</text>
    <text class="head-note">采购商与供货方的订单、货款、价目与账号权限。订单与货款只读，改单请走 ERP「出货中心」。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tabs">
    <view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="key" class="tab {{tab === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onTab">
      <text class="tab-text">{{item.label}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{flash}}" class="flash {{flashErr ? 'err' : ''}}">
    <text class="flash-text">{{flash}}</text>
  </view>

  <!-- ─── 大盘 ─── -->
  <block wx:if="{{tab === 'dash'}}">
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{dash.range === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onDashRange">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{dash.loading && !dash.view}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">正在汇总…</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{dash.error}}" class="state err">
      <text class="state-title">大盘加载失败</text>
      <text class="state-body">{{dash.error}}</text>
      <view class="state-retry" bindtap="retry"><text class="state-retry-text">重试</text></view>
    </view>
    <block wx:elif="{{dash.view}}">
      <view class="kpi-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{dash.view.kpis}}" wx:key="key" class="kpi {{item.tone}}" hover-class="card-press" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onDashKpi">
          <text class="kpi-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="kpi-value">{{item.value}}</text>
          <text class="kpi-sub">{{item.sub}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{dash.view.extras.length}}" class="section">
        <text wx:for="{{dash.view.extras}}" wx:key="*this" class="card-meta">· {{item}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">货款账龄</text>
        <text class="section-sub">未结清的采购商单（待收款 / 对公待确认 / 金额待核对），按下单日到今天的北京时间自然日计。共 {{dash.view.agingTotal}} 单。</text>
        <view wx:for="{{dash.view.aging}}" wx:key="key" class="bar-row">
          <text class="bar-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <view class="bar-track">
            <view class="bar-fill {{item.warn ? 'warn' : ''}}" style="width: {{item.pct}}%"></view>
          </view>
          <text class="bar-value">{{item.count}} 单</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">应付供货方</text>
        <view class="card">
          <view class="card-row">
            <view class="card-main">
              <text class="card-title">已发货 / 已签收 {{dash.view.payable.count}} 单</text>
              <text class="card-meta">{{dash.view.payable.note}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="card-side">
              <text class="card-amount">{{dash.view.payable.amountText}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">按伙伴（前 10）</text>
        <view wx:if="{{!dash.view.byPartner.length}}" class="state">
          <text class="state-body">所选范围内还没有采购商 / 供货方单据。</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:for="{{dash.view.byPartner}}" wx:key="key" class="card" hover-class="card-press" data-key="{{item.key}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="onDashPartner">
          <view class="card-row">
            <view class="card-main">
              <text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text>
              <text class="card-meta">{{item.kindLabel}} · {{item.count}} 单 {{item.dueText}}</text>
            </view>
            <view class="card-side">
              <text class="card-amount">{{item.amountText}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="section">
        <text class="section-title">账号与价目</text>
        <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">采购商账号</text><text class="kv-v">{{dash.view.partnerStats.buyers}}</text></view>
        <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">供货方账号</text><text class="kv-v">{{dash.view.partnerStats.suppliers}}</text></view>
        <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">已停用</text><text class="kv-v">{{dash.view.partnerStats.disabled}}</text></view>
        <view class="kv"><text class="kv-k">价目上架 / 下架</text><text class="kv-v">{{dash.view.priceStats.active}} / {{dash.view.priceStats.inactive}}</text></view>
      </view>

      <text class="foot">口径：订单时间取提交时间（无则创建时间），按北京时间自然日；已取消单不计金额；已收款以微信实收（paidFen）为准；「验收标记」是超管旁路，不算真实收款。{{dash.view.truncated ? '单据超过 2000 张，仅统计最近读取的部分。' : ''}}</text>
    </block>
  </block>

  <!-- ─── 订单（只读）─── -->
  <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'orders'}}">
    <view class="search">
      <input class="search-input" placeholder="单号 / 公司 / 联系人 / 品名" value="{{orders.keyword}}" confirm-type="search" bindinput="onOrderKeyword" bindconfirm="onOrderSearch" />
      <view class="search-go" bindtap="onOrderSearch"><text class="search-go-text">搜索</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{orders.partner}}" class="flash">
      <text class="flash-text">只看：{{orders.partnerName || orders.partner}}　</text>
      <text class="link" bindtap="onClearPartner">清除</text>
    </view>
    <text class="row-label">时间</text>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{orders.range === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-field="range" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onOrderFilter">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="row-label">方向</text>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{directions}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{orders.direction === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-field="direction" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onOrderFilter">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="row-label">履约</text>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{stages}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{orders.stage === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-field="stage" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onOrderFilter">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="row-label">货款</text>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{pays}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{orders.pay === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-field="pay" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onOrderFilter">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{orders.loading}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">正在读取订单…</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{orders.error}}" class="state err">
      <text class="state-title">订单加载失败</text>
      <text class="state-body">{{orders.error}}</text>
      <view class="state-retry" bindtap="retry"><text class="state-retry-text">重试</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!orders.list.length}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">没有符合条件的订单</text>
      <text class="state-body">放宽时间或筛选条件试试。采购商在「采购商工作台」下单后会出现在这里。</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <text class="row-label">共 {{orders.total}} 单</text>
      <view wx:for="{{orders.list}}" wx:key="_id" class="card" hover-class="card-press" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="openOrder">
        <view class="card-row">
          <view class="card-main">
            <text class="card-title">{{item.partnerName}}</text>
            <text class="card-meta">{{item.title}} · {{item.qty}} 件</text>
            <text class="card-meta">{{item.dateText}} · {{item.orderNo || item._id}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="card-side">
            <text class="card-amount">{{item.amountText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="tags">
          <view class="tag"><text class="tag-text">{{item.directionLabel}}</text></view>
          <view class="tag {{item.stageTone}}"><text class="tag-text">{{item.stageLabel}}</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.payBucket !== 'na'}}" class="tag {{item.payTone}}"><text class="tag-text">{{item.payLabel}}</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.overdue}}" class="tag danger"><text class="tag-text">超期 {{item.agingDays}} 天</text></view>
          <view wx:elif="{{item.agingOpen}}" class="tag"><text class="tag-text">账龄 {{item.agingDays}} 天</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.trackingNo}}" class="tag brass"><text class="tag-text">运单 {{item.trackingNo}}</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{orders.loadingMore}}" class="foot">加载更多…</text>
      <text wx:elif="{{!orders.hasMore}}" class="foot">已到底。{{orders.truncated ? '单据超过 2000 张，仅检索最近读取的部分。' : ''}}</text>
    </block>
  </block>

  <!-- ─── 价目 ─── -->
  <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'price'}}">
    <view class="search">
      <input class="search-input" placeholder="品名 / skuId / 物种" value="{{price.keyword}}" confirm-type="search" bindinput="onPriceKeyword" bindconfirm="onPriceSearch" />
      <view class="search-go" bindtap="onPriceSearch"><text class="search-go-text">搜索</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="chips">
      <view wx:for="{{priceStatuses}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{price.status === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onPriceStatus">
        <text class="chip-text">{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn" hover-class="btn-press" bindtap="newPrice"><text class="btn-text">新建价目</text></view>

    <view wx:if="{{price.loading}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">正在读取价目…</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{price.error}}" class="state err">
      <text class="state-title">价目加载失败</text>
      <text class="state-body">{{price.error}}</text>
      <view class="state-retry" bindtap="retry"><text class="state-retry-text">重试</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!price.list.length}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">没有符合条件的价目</text>
      <text class="state-body">点「新建价目」添加；采购商只能看到「上架中」的条目。</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <text class="row-label">共 {{price.total}} 条 · 全部 {{price.counts.all}} / 上架 {{price.counts.active}}{{price.canMove ? '' : ' · 清空搜索与筛选后可调整顺序'}}</text>
      <view wx:for="{{price.list}}" wx:key="_id" class="card">
        <view class="card-row" hover-class="card-press" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="editPrice">
          <view class="card-main">
            <text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="card-meta">{{item.skuId}} · {{item.species}} · {{item.packaging}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.refCount}}" class="card-meta">已被 {{item.refCount}} 张单据引用（删除将改为停用）</text>
          </view>
          <view class="card-side">
            <text class="card-amount">{{item.priceText}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.guideText}}" class="card-meta">指导 {{item.guideText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="tags">
          <view class="tag {{item.status === 'active' ? 'ok' : ''}}" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-status="{{item.status}}" bindtap="togglePrice">
            <text class="tag-text">{{price.busyId === item._id ? '处理中…' : item.status === 'active' ? '上架中 · 点此下架' : item.retired ? '已停用 · 点此上架' : '已下架 · 点此上架'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view wx:if="{{price.canMove}}" class="tag" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-dir="up" bindtap="movePrice"><text class="tag-text">上移</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{price.canMove}}" class="tag" data-id="{{item._id}}" data-dir="down" bindtap="movePrice"><text class="tag-text">下移</text></view>
          <view class="tag brass" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="editPrice"><text class="tag-text">编辑</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{price.loadingMore}}" class="foot">加载更多…</text>
      <text wx:elif="{{!price.hasMore}}" class="foot">已到底。删除请进入编辑页；被单据引用过的条目只会停用，不会被硬删。</text>
    </block>
  </block>

  <!-- ─── 伙伴 ─── -->
  <block wx:elif="{{tab === 'partners'}}">
    <view class="chips">
      <view class="chip {{partners.status === '' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="" bindtap="onPartnerStatus"><text class="chip-text">全部</text></view>
      <view class="chip {{partners.status === 'active' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="active" bindtap="onPartnerStatus"><text class="chip-text">启用中</text></view>
      <view class="chip {{partners.status === 'disabled' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="disabled" bindtap="onPartnerStatus"><text class="chip-text">已停用</text></view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{partners.loading}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">正在读取伙伴…</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{partners.error}}" class="state err">
      <text class="state-title">伙伴加载失败</text>
      <text class="state-body">{{partners.error}}</text>
      <view class="state-retry" bindtap="retry"><text class="state-retry-text">重试</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!partners.list.length}}" class="state">
      <text class="state-title">还没有采购商 / 供货方账号</text>
      <text class="state-body">开通账号在「店员花名册」：添加成员时角色选「采购商」或「供货方」。开通后回到这里配置功能项。</text>
      <view class="state-retry" bindtap="goStaffDirectory"><text class="state-retry-text">去店员花名册</text></view>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view wx:for="{{partners.list}}" wx:key="staffId" class="card" hover-class="card-press" data-id="{{item.staffId}}" bindtap="openPartner">
        <view class="card-row">
          <view class="card-main">
            <text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="card-meta">{{item.sideText}} · 尾号 {{item.openidTail}}{{item.supplierId ? ' · ' + item.supplierId : ''}}</text>
            <text class="card-meta">{{item.orders.count}} 单 · 最近 {{item.orders.lastText || '—'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="card-side">
            <text class="card-amount">{{item.orders.amountText}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.orders.dueFen}}" class="card-meta">待收 {{item.orders.dueText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="tags">
          <view class="tag {{item.status === 'active' ? 'ok' : 'danger'}}"><text class="tag-text">{{item.status === 'active' ? '启用中' : '已停用'}}</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.offCount}}" class="tag warn"><text class="tag-text">关闭 {{item.offCount}} 项功能</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{!item.b2bOnly}}" class="tag"><text class="tag-text">兼门店角色</text></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.orders.overdue}}" class="tag danger"><text class="tag-text">{{item.orders.overdue}} 单超期</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="btn ghost" hover-class="btn-press" bindtap="goStaffDirectory"><text class="btn-text">开通新伙伴（店员花名册）</text></view>
    </block>
  </block>

  <view class="btn ghost" hover-class="btn-press" bindtap="goPreview"><text class="btn-text">以伙伴视角预览工作台</text></view>
</view>
